<view class="page feature-page arrival-page"><brand-header back="{{true}}" title="到院指引"></brand-header><view class="pad"><view class="feature-panel panel"><view class="between"><text class="section-title">{{clinic.name}}</text><button class="more" bindtap="chooseClinic">切换院区<ui-icon name="chevron" size="22"></ui-icon></button></view><image wx:if="{{clinic.mapImage}}" class="arrival-map-photo" src="{{clinic.mapImage}}" mode="widthFix" aria-label="{{clinic.name}}周边地图"></image><view wx:else class="arrival-map"><ui-icon name="pin" active="{{true}}" size="58"></ui-icon><text>{{city}} · 院区位置示意</text></view><view class="feature-info-row"><ui-icon name="pin" size="32"></ui-icon><text>{{clinic.address}}</text></view><view class="feature-info-row"><ui-icon name="clock" size="32"></ui-icon><text>营业时间 {{clinic.hours}}</text></view><view class="card-note">真实地址、交通路线和停车信息待机构配置。</view></view><view class="feature-panel panel"><view class="section-title">到院流程</view><view class="arrival-step" wx:for="{{steps}}" wx:key="number"><view class="arrival-step-number">{{item.number}}</view><view><view class="arrival-step-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="card-note">{{item.text}}</view></view></view></view><view class="notice">院区与流程为页面示例，实际到院安排以机构通知为准。</view></view></view>
